            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Never miss a meeting

- **Record your calls with one click.** When you start a call in Zoom, Teams, Meet, FaceTime or another app, WaveVoice asks if you want to record it. If you don’t answer, the prompt goes away on its own.
- **Stop when you hang up.** When the call ends, WaveVoice offers to stop recording, so your meeting is ready without you having to remember.
- **A refreshed installer** that’s clearer and matches the WaveVoice look.

You can turn the call prompt on or off in Settings → Meeting Recording.
]]></description>
