            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Signed and verified by Apple

- WaveVoice is now signed with an Apple Developer ID and notarized by Apple, so macOS opens it without security warnings.
- Because of the new signature, macOS may ask you once more for Accessibility permission (System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility).
- These notes now also appear in What's New inside the app.
]]></description>
